### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### 1. Public Sign-in (Password Authentication)
# @name signin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "TEST-owner@archscale.test",
    "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store token from signin response
@accessToken = {{signin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. MFA Verify (Upgrade to AAL2 using TOTP code)
# @name mfaVerify
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/mfa/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "code": "123456"
}

### Store upgraded AAL2 token
@aal2Token = {{mfaVerify.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. List Memberships (Pre-Context)
# @name memberships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session/memberships
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}

### 4. List Workspaces for Selected Organisation
# @name workspaces
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/session/workspaces?organisationId={{memberships.response.body.memberships[0].organisation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}

### 5. Create 24h Access Context
# @name createContext
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/context
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}

{
    "organisationId": "{{memberships.response.body.memberships[0].organisation_id}}",
    "workspaceId": "{{workspaces.response.body.workspaces[0].workspace_id}}"
}

### Store context ID
@contextId = {{createContext.response.body.context.contextId}}

### 6. Call /api/me (Context-bound session endpoint)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}
X-ArchScale-Context: {{contextId}}

### 7. Call Protected Member List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/org/members
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}
X-ArchScale-Context: {{contextId}}

### 8. Call Protected Member Invitation (Mutation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/org/invitations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}
X-ArchScale-Context: {{contextId}}

{
    "email": "invitee@archscale.test",
    "roleKey": "leader"
}

### 9. Renew Context (Extends up to 24h hard cap)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/context/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}
X-ArchScale-Context: {{contextId}}

### 10. Logout (Revokes session token and context)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{aal2Token}}
X-ArchScale-Context: {{contextId}}

